        "Description": "Good Day 47,\rIts World Bee Day today (According to liquidmf and Google). And coincidently your targets are also a part of a secret organization called as The Bee Hive.\rYour mission is simple, bee stealthy, sting swiftly and leave no hive witnesses behind. The clients are pollen for justice and these marks won’t be pollen any favors after tonight. Remember, every bee has its final day. Time to turn this colony into a dead hive.\r\rGood Luck.\r\rBy - SW",
